NOTE ON MODELS AND DATA (not covered by this license)

This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only. It does NOT
cover the machine-learning models the project downloads and uses at runtime,
each of which carries its own separate license and usage terms, for example:

  - AI4Bharat IndicTrans2 (translation)     - gated on HuggingFace
  - AI4Bharat Indic-Parler-TTS (voice)      - gated on HuggingFace
  - OpenAI Whisper / faster-whisper (ASR)
  - vasista22 Whisper fine-tunes (Hindi/Kannada ASR)
  - emotion2vec / FunASR (vocal-tone emotion)
  - j-hartmann emotion RoBERTa (text emotion)

You are responsible for reviewing and complying with each model's license and,
where required, requesting access on HuggingFace before use.

